{"duration_api_ms":84398,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f9c56721-62e3-4804-83b3-fd93c58d4a26","total_cost_usd":0.5540470000000001,"usage":{"input_tokens":28,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32408,"cache_read_input_tokens":771555,"output_tokens":7018,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1513},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32408,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":875,"cache_read_input_tokens":62924,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1822,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1822},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":28,"outputTokens":7018,"cacheReadInputTokens":771555,"cacheCreationInputTokens":32408,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5540470000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1513,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":32408,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":14,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I made no code change: the server already does what the packet asks. The 5 s wait can't be removed safely from the server alone, because a tab close and a page reload look the same to it. One acceptance command passed and the other failed before it measured anything.\n\n**What I found**\n- **Server:** an explicit `{type:\"close\"}` socket message already calls `closeDocument` with no reason. That gives `noDelay = !reason || getIsShutdown()` (`DocService/sources/DocsCoServer.js:2191`), so the save starts right away with no `savetimeoutdelay`.\n- **Client (read from the installed minified build):** nothing is sent on tab close. In web-apps, `onBeforeUnload` only saves local storage and `onUnload` only clears a timer. `{type:\"close\"}` is only sent when the editor is closed through the API (`asc_coAuthoringDisconnect`).\n- **socket.io:** the client drops the connection on page unload (its `closeOnBeforeunload` option is on). The server logs `transport close`, exactly as for a reload or a killed tab. So a real browser close looks the same as Playwright's `page.close()`.\n\n**Decision**\n- Saving immediately on `transport close` would break the packet's first preserve clause: someone who reloads within 5 s must still find the session open. Only the integrator knows a close is final, so I left the server as it is.\n- I filed a follow-up request in `.theseus/spawn/`: add a save-journey variant that closes the editor through the integrator, so the client sends `{type:\"close\"}`, and measure it. The expected result is about 0.85 s.\n\n**Acceptance**\n- `.theseus/oracle/unit.sh`: passes (178 passed, 1 skipped).\n- `bash .theseus/oracle/journeys/save.sh`: **fails before measuring.** `serve-integrated.sh` line 29 can't find `external/sdkjs/build`, because `external/` isn't checked out in this worktree. That's a factory problem, and I put it in my friction line. Since no code changed, the journey number wouldn't have moved anyway.\n\n`theseus validate` shows 0 errors, `theseus scope-check` is clean, and the work is committed as `6d62707`. That commit has the executor log, the lessons and the spawned request, plus my friction line.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas**\n- The save delay is skipped only for the explicit `close` message or a server shutdown. Every browser close or reload arrives as `transport close` and pays the full 5 s.\n- web-apps sends nothing when the page closes. An explicit close can only come through the API.","ttft_ms":3229,"type":"result","duration_ms":146272,"uuid":"2ce5e417-e549-4ab7-8406-afbd0185fd29","ttft_stream_ms":2162,"time_to_request_ms":161,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":23,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":4,"input_attachments":21,"input_hooks":4,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":15,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":7,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":21,"query_setup":7,"auto_mode_context_wait":6,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":24,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":2,"request_build":5},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":39,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":123,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":203,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":130,"process_rss_mib_result":214,"process_anon_mib_result":125,"process_peak_rss_mib":225,"process_cpu_ms_turn":2642,"process_wall_ms_turn":146271,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":1135,"process_wall_ms_streaming":61067,"main_stream_count":14,"main_stream_event_count":999,"main_stream_chunk_count":633,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":1135,"wall_ms":61067,"entries":14},"tool":{"cpu_ms":681,"wall_ms":61297,"entries":13},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":415,"wall_ms":23225,"entries":14},"before_first_request":{"cpu_ms":123,"wall_ms":161,"entries":1},"between_requests":{"cpu_ms":277,"wall_ms":457,"entries":13},"after_last_request":{"cpu_ms":11,"wall_ms":64,"entries":1}},"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":8,"cpu_ms":18,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":8,"ambient_wait_ms":8,"render_ms":2,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"tool_schema_build_detail":{"betas_ms":0